OL,3,AWhat we know so far about Jensen
OL,4,AHuang's affair with suspected Chinese
OL,5,Aspy
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of the Artificial Intelligence (AI)
OL,8,Findustry's most important figures has
OL,9,Fbeen accused of having an affair with a
OL,10,Fsuspected Chinese spy, prompting an
OL,11,Finvestigation.
OL,13,FUS intelligence officials believed that
OL,14,FChinese businesswoman Alice Huang, who
OL,15,Fhad a close relationship with Nvidia
OL,16,FCEO and co-founder Jensen Huang, was a
OL,17,Fspy for Beijing, according to a New
OL,18,FYork Times report.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11904
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794269907
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AWhat we know so far about Jensen
OL,4,AHuang's affair with suspected Chinese
OL,5,Aspy
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Sunday, Huang admitted to having
OL,8,Fbeen "unfaithful" to his wife and
OL,9,Fapologised for hurting her and their
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FUS tech giant Nvidia, one of the most
OL,13,Fvaluable companies in the world, has
OL,14,Fopened an independent investigation
OL,15,Finto the reports. The firm said it does
OL,16,Fnot believe US national security had
OL,17,Fbeen compromised - and added that Huang
OL,18,Fwas committed to continuing to lead the
OL,19,Fcompany.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
